{"suttaId":"thag10.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2346,2376],"vripara":"557"},"segments":{"thag10.4:0.4":"Cūḷapanthakattheragāthā","thag10.4:1.1":"“Dandhā mayhaṃ gatī āsi, paribhūto pure ahaṃ;","thag10.4:1.3":"Bhātā ca maṃ paṇāmesi,‘gaccha dāni tuvaṃ gharaṃ’.","thag10.4:2.1":"“Sohaṃ paṇāmito santo [bhātā (aṭṭha.)], saṅghārāmassa koṭṭhake;","thag10.4:2.3":"Dummano tattha aṭṭhāsiṃ, sāsanasmiṃ apekkhavā.","thag10.4:3.1":"“Bhagavā tattha āgacchi [āgañchi (sī. pī.)], sīsaṃ mayhaṃ parāmasi;","thag10.4:3.3":"Bāhāya maṃ gahetvāna, saṅghārāmaṃ pavesayi.","thag10.4:4.1":"“Anukampāya me satthā, pādāsi pādapuñchaniṃ;","thag10.4:4.3":"‘Etaṃ suddhaṃ adhiṭṭhehi, ekamantaṃ svadhiṭṭhitaṃ’.","thag10.4:5.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, vihāsiṃ sāsane rato;","thag10.4:5.3":"Samādhiṃ paṭipādesiṃ, uttamatthassa pattiyā.","thag10.4:6.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thag10.4:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thag10.4:7.1":"“Sahassakkhattumattānaṃ, nimminitvāna panthako;","thag10.4:7.3":"Nisīdambavane ramme, yāva kālappavedanā.","thag10.4:8.1":"“Tato me satthā pāhesi, dūtaṃ kālappavedakaṃ;","thag10.4:8.3":"Paveditamhi kālamhi, vehāsādupasaṅkamiṃ [vehāsānupasaṅkamiṃ (syā. ka.)].","thag10.4:9.1":"“Vanditvā satthuno pāde, ekamantaṃ nisīdahaṃ;","thag10.4:9.3":"Nisinnaṃ maṃ viditvāna, atha satthā paṭiggahi.","thag10.4:10.1":"“Āyāgo sabbalokassa, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","thag10.4:10.3":"Puññakkhettaṃ manussānaṃ, paṭigaṇhittha dakkhiṇan”ti.","thag10.4:10.5":"… Cūḷapanthako thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
